{
  "job_A1.1_20251003_114141": {
    "chunk_text": "ruwode wel Gesett h\u00e6fde he hie swa ges\u00e6liglice, \u00e6nne h\u00e6fde he swa swi\u00f0ne geworhtne, swa mihtigne on his Lof sceolde he drihtnes wyrcean, dyran sceolde he his dreamas on heofonum, and sceolde his drihtne Ac he awende hit him to wyrsan \u00feinge, ongan him winn up ahebban wi\u00f0 \u00feone hehstan heofnes Deore w\u00e6s he drihtne urum; ne mihte him bedyrned weor\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t his engyl ongan ofermod wesan, Ne meahte he \u00e6t his hige findan \u00fe\u00e6t he gode wolde geongerdome, \u00feeodne \u00feeowian. \u00deuhte him sylfum \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6gyn and cr\u00e6ft maran h\u00e6fde \u00feonne se halga god habban mihte Feala worda gesp\u00e6c se engel ofermodes. \u00deohte \u00feurh his anes cr\u00e6ft hu he him strenglicran stol geworhte, heahran on heofonum; cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hine \"Hw\u00e6t sceal ic winnan\" cw\u00e6\u00f0 he. \"Nis me wiht\u00e6 \u00feearf hearran to habbanne. Ic m\u00e6g mid handum swa fela wundra gewyrcean. Ic h\u00e6bbe geweald micel to gyrwanne godlecran stol, hearran on heofne. Hwy sceal ic \u00e6fter his hyldo \u00f0eowian, bugan him swilces geongordomes? Ic m\u00e6g wesan god swa he. Bigstanda\u00f0 me strange geneatas, \u00fea ne willa\u00f0 me \u00e6t \u00feam stri\u00f0e geswican, h\u00e6le\u00feas heardmode. Hie habba\u00f0 me to hearran gecorene, rofe rincas; mid swilcum m\u00e6g man r\u00e6d ge\u00feencean, fon mid Frynd synd hie mine georne,",
